00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.720
- Yeah.
So, what we're noticing, Seth,

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:03.450
is in this revolution of AI,

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.500
and in this time,

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.790
people want to be able
to talk to machines

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.460
