00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:12.930
to be able to understand
the conversation,

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:15.590
understand the context
behind the questions.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:20.430
And get the answers directly
without having to read a lot of documents

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.500
that the traditional
search engines provided.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.310
Malesh talked about the speakers.
You know?

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:29.960
There's a lot of devices that are coming to the market
