00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.320
what is the area and population?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:02.610
In the traditional search engines,
they'll have to repeat Singapore all the time.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.880
Repeat the context of
Singapore all the time.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.920
And we are trying to solve
that problem here,

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:11.150
